{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42649","headline":"感怀呈所知 · 谭用之","name":"感怀呈所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年流落赋归鸿，谁傍昏衢驾烛龙。\n竹屋乱烟思梓泽，酒家疎雨梦临邛。\n千年别恨调琴懒，一片年光览镜慵。\n早晚休歌白石烂，放教归去卧羣峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谭用之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}